{
  "id": "chap-2",
  "title": "Where the Map Ends",
  "collectionIds": [
    "col-main"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk-1",
      "type": "scene",
      "locationName": "Northern Cliffs",
      "timeOfDay": "Night",
      "backgroundLabel": "cliffs_night.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-2",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The new line was still there.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-3",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Mira held the map beneath the lighthouse beam, turning the paper toward the light as if the angle might explain what she was seeing. A thin black stroke now extended beyond the northern coastline, disappearing into a part of the sea the map had always left blank.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>You didn't draw that?</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>Do you think I'd be this worried if I did?</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-6",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Holt leaned closer. His shadow fell across the paper.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-7",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Maybe the ink was hidden underneath something.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-8",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>Holt.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-9",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>I'm trying to be helpful.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-10",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The wind snapped the edge of the map against Mira's hand. She folded it quickly and tucked it beneath her coat.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>We're going to the lighthouse.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Tonight?</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-13",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>Before that island decides to move somewhere else.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-14",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Holt looked toward the dark water.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-15",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>You know that's exactly the kind of sentence that should make us go home.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-16",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>Then you're free to go home.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-17",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>She started down the cliff path.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-18",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>After a few seconds, footsteps followed.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-19",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>I hate when you're right.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-20",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>That must be exhausting for you.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-21",
      "type": "scene",
      "locationName": "Old Lighthouse Road",
      "timeOfDay": "Night",
      "backgroundLabel": "lighthouse_road_night.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-22",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The road to the lighthouse had been closed for almost twenty years.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-23",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Officially, the cliff had become unstable. Unofficially, people had stopped using it after the keeper disappeared.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-24",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Remind me why we're taking the haunted road?</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-25",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>It's not haunted.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-26",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>The lighthouse keeper vanished.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-27",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>People vanish all the time.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-28",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>That's somehow worse.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-29",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The road narrowed as they descended. Grass pushed through cracks in the old stone, brushing against their boots. Ahead, the lighthouse continued its slow, steady rotation.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-30",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Mira stopped.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-31",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>What is it?</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-32",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>She pointed toward the road.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-33",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Fresh footprints marked the mud ahead of them.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-34",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Maybe someone else is taking the haunted road.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-35",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>They're barefoot.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-36",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The footprints continued toward the lighthouse.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-37",
      "type": "scene",
      "locationName": "The Lighthouse",
      "timeOfDay": "Night",
      "backgroundLabel": "lighthouse_night.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-38",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The front door was open.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-39",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Nope.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-40",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>We came all this way.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-41",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Exactly. Let's not waste the walk by dying immediately.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-42",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Mira ignored him and stepped inside.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-43",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The interior smelled of dust, salt, and something faintly metallic. The spiral staircase rose into darkness, disappearing toward the lantern room.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-44",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>I really wish you wouldn't do that.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-45",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>Do what?</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-46",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Walk into obviously dangerous places like they personally offended you.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-47",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>For the first time that night, Mira smiled.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-48",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Then the lighthouse stopped turning.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-49",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Darkness swallowed the room.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-50",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>Mira?</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-51",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-mira",
      "html": "<p>I'm here.</p>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-52",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Something moved somewhere above them.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-53",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>Then, from the top of the staircase, a voice called down.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-54",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "characterId": "char-holt",
      "html": "<p>That's not funny.</p>",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-55",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p>The voice came again.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-56",
      "type": "narration",
      "html": "<p><strong>&ldquo;You shouldn't have followed the new line.&rdquo;</strong></p>"
    }
  ]
}